    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ae41aff8b2f37.84701287\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">In the latest Patch 12.1.7 PTR build, items to learn two new housing exterior customization options have been discovered!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-320\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"live\" data-env=\"ptr\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 320px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"ptr\" data-tree=\"live\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins class=\"lazy-load-background\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/8262637.jpg&quot;);\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q3\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=289446/icy-cabin-burrow\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Icy Cabin Burrow</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><br><span style=\"color: #66BBFF\">Artisanal House</span><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br><span class=\"q7\">Binds to Warband</span><!--ue--><!--ue--><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/spell=1328439/collect-icy-cabin-burrow\" class=\"q2\">Unlock the Icy Cabin Burrow house exterior for your account.</a><!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span>&nbsp;<span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-320\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"live\" data-env=\"ptr\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 320px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"ptr\" data-tree=\"live\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins class=\"lazy-load-background\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/8262637.jpg&quot;);\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q3\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=289445/cozy-cabin-burrow\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Cozy Cabin Burrow</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><br><span style=\"color: #66BBFF\">Artisanal House</span><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br><span class=\"q7\">Binds to Warband</span><!--ue--><!--ue--><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/spell=1328437/collect-cozy-cabin-burrow\" class=\"q2\">Unlock the Cozy Cabin Burrow house exterior for your account.</a><!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span></div><br><br>Neither item currently has a source, and the appearances of both are encrypted, so we can't see what they look like. However, it's highly likely that these two exteriors are linked to the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/new-cabin-themed-shop-decor-discovered-in-patch-12-1-7-383593\" data-contiguous=\"true\">cozy cabin decor recently datamined</a> in a prior 12.1.7 build.<br><br>That decor is listed with the In-Game shop as a source, and players have been very vocal regarding their desire to be able to earn these new customizations in-game. It's possible that the Cozy and Icy cabins are also related to an upcoming shop pack, but it's equally possible that these could become available from the same neighborhood vendors that sell the <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/item=282340/autumnal-westfall-barn-facade-plans\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Autumnal Westfall Barn Facade Plans\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/garrison_building_barn.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Autumnal Westfall Barn Facade Plans</span></a> and <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/item=282343/springtime-westfall-barn-facade-plans\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Springtime Westfall Barn Facade Plans\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/garrison_building_barn.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Springtime Westfall Barn Facade Plans</span></a> exteriors.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>In the latest Patch 12.1.7 PTR build, items to learn two new housing exterior customization options have been discovered!<br /><br />Neither item currently has a source, and the appearances of both are encrypted, so we can't see what they look like. However, it's highly likely that these two exteriors are linked to the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/new-cabin-themed-shop-decor-discovered-in-patch-12-1-7-383593\">cozy cabin decor recently datamined</a> in a prior 12.1.7 build.<br /><br />That decor is listed with the In-Game shop as a source, and players have been very vocal regarding their desire to be able to earn these new customizations in-game. It's possible that the Cozy and Icy cabins are also related to an upcoming shop pack, but it's equally possible that these could become available from the same neighborhood vendors that sell the <a href=\"/item=282340/autumnal-westfall-barn-facade-plans\">Autumnal Westfall Barn Facade Plans</a> and <a href=\"/item=282343/springtime-westfall-barn-facade-plans\">Springtime Westfall Barn Facade Plans</a> exteriors.</noscript>            \n        ",
