    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ae41b23b8e130.19047161\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted 12.1.7 PTR development notes for today, which reminds players that the Talebound Demo is available tomorrow!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/talebound-overview-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Talebound Guide</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_waycrestmannor.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2383391/5\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The 12.1.7 PTR has been updated and will be available for testing when the Talebound demo becomes available tomorrow.<h2 id=\"tales-take-a-dark-turn-in-talebound\" class=\"heading-size-2\"><b>TALES TAKE A DARK TURN IN TALEBOUND</b></h2><a href=\"https://d2ertrwg9e34np.cloudfront.net/original/1X/59e8d7e6718c56fed45d1e5f194f0f0e06003b2a.jpeg\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image no-border\" width=\"833\" src=\"https://d2ertrwg9e34np.cloudfront.net/optimized/1X/59e8d7e6718c56fed45d1e5f194f0f0e06003b2a_2_833x468.jpeg\" alt=\"\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.7799145299145298\"></a><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-source=\"false\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Talebound will be available for testing this weekend</b><br><i>October 30 at 10:00am PDT through November 2 at 10:00am PDT</i></div></div>Prepare to be drawn into the macabre world of Talebound, where you become part of the dark chronicles of a mysterious Storyteller, chillingly brought to life in a new PvE action RPG game mode.<br><br>Venture solo or with friends through eerie tales where danger is written on every page. Battle fearsome enemies and bosses, solve perplexing puzzles, discover treasure and relics, and earn Bound Silver for cosmetic rewards as you delve deeper into the Storyteller’s twisted creations.<br><br>More details on the Talebound demo can be found in the article: <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24313107/join-in-the-talebound-demo-on-october-30\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">https://<wbr>worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/<wbr>news/<wbr>24313107/<wbr>join-in-the-talebound-demo-on-october-30</a></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted 12.1.7 PTR development notes for today, which reminds players that the Talebound Demo is available tomorrow!<br /><br />Talebound Guide<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">The 12.1.7 PTR has been updated and will be available for testing when the Talebound demo becomes available tomorrow.<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"><b>TALES TAKE A DARK TURN IN TALEBOUND</b></h2><br /><br /><a href=\"https://d2ertrwg9e34np.cloudfront.net/original/1X/59e8d7e6718c56fed45d1e5f194f0f0e06003b2a.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><br /><br /><b>Talebound will be available for testing this weekend</b><br /><i>October 30 at 10:00am PDT through November 2 at 10:00am PDT</i><br /></div></div><br />Prepare to be drawn into the macabre world of Talebound, where you become part of the dark chronicles of a mysterious Storyteller, chillingly brought to life in a new PvE action RPG game mode.<br /><br />Venture solo or with friends through eerie tales where danger is written on every page. Battle fearsome enemies and bosses, solve perplexing puzzles, discover treasure and relics, and earn Bound Silver for cosmetic rewards as you delve deeper into the Storyteller’s twisted creations.<br /><br />More details on the Talebound demo can be found in the article: <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24313107/join-in-the-talebound-demo-on-october-30\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24313107/join-in-the-talebound-demo-on-october-30</a></noscript>            \n        ",
